    [Doc]Add “huawei” before the specified “ascend” text. (#19927)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    As required, replace standalone “Ascend” references with “Huawei Ascend”
    on third-party open-source community homepages, secondary pages, and
    About sections. Using the combined name makes the Huawei brand more
    prominent and reduces potential confusion or misunderstanding.
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    N/A
